# Architecture companion

Pages under `docs/architecture/` except `index.mdx`. Created only by `@high-level-architecture`.

Skip this rule for `docs/architecture/index.mdx` (plugin anchor, unlisted, not a companion).

## Frontmatter

```yaml
id: {slug}
slug: /{slug}
title: "{Story}: High-level architecture"
description: "{one line}"
draft: true
pagination_prev: null
pagination_next: null
```

Docusaurus docs cannot be `draft` and `unlisted` at once. Draft with `draft: true` only. At publish, remove `draft` and set `unlisted: true`. Do not add insight `tags`, `authors`, or `homepage`. Do not put these files under `docs/insights/`.

## Required body

Hero PNG co-located as `{slug}.png`, then six H2s in this order:

1. Problem statement
2. Assumptions
3. Service diagram
4. Per-service role, APIs, and store keys
5. Swim lanes per interaction
6. Failure points (load, RPS, memory, and shed are rows here, not a second table)

Open and close with a back-link to the parent System Design insight. No `:::tip[THE CLAIM]`, no `## Where I land`, no `## Key takeaways`.

## Discovery

One inbound link from the parent insight. No navbar item, no Insights card, no sitemap section, no docs sidebar entry.

Full packet: `.cursor/skills/high-level-architecture/SKILL.md` and `reference.md`.
